      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Wilsall sits within the homelands of the Apsáalooke (Crow) people, who have stewarded the valley and its waterways for generations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
